# Cloudflare Pages redirects — keep old WordPress URLs alive.
# Sections that live only on the one-pager land on the matching anchor;
# rooms have pages of their own, at renamed URLs, so their old paths are
# forwarded to the new ones.

# Rooms
# Each room now lives at a URL that says its name. WordPress had
# published them under slugs that often described something else
# entirely — Kuukoda at "tiigimaja", Imedemaa veesilm at
# "indiaanisaun-3" — and those old URLs are indexed, so every one of
# them is redirected rather than dropped. A 301 carries the ranking
# across; deleting the URL would not.
